S,GL2CPLabels,"List of the Cummins-Pauli labels of the intersection of the specified subgroup H with SL2, as defined in https://doi.org/10.1080/10586458.2003.10504495., or the empty list for groups of genus > 24. Note that Cummins and Pauli labels identify PGL(2,Z) conjugacy classes of subgroups of PSL(2,Z) (which are represented as subgroups of SL(2,Z) containing -I), but subgroups with distinct CP labels may be conjugate in GL(2,Zhat), so we return a list of all labels that could match a GL2-conjugate of H",0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,GrpMat,,SeqEnum,Null,Null,Null,Null,Null
